Author: Docaari <ricardinho2012@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Apr 29 15:18:09 2026 -0300

    feat(primedope): F4 — variance simulation + grade day drill-down
    
    Sprint F4 entrega 2 capacidades em /coach (GradePlanner):
    
    1. Drill-down "Detalhes do Dia" — Drawer Radix Sheet com agregados
       por (perfil, dia): %PKO/%Turbo/%Vanilla, banca por plataforma,
       ABI USD, investimento total. Botao "Detalhes" no header de cada
       coluna do WeekGrid (oculto quando perfil=OFF).
    
    2. Painel PrimeDope — Wizard editavel + simulacao de variance MTT
       via primedope.com (provider externo plugavel ADR-054). Cache
       30min, fallback stale 24h, semaphore inline max=3, retry 1x
       backoff 500ms em 5xx. FX cascata users>wallets>fallback constante
       (reuso currencyNormalizer + ADR-033). Onboarding 3-cards com
       localStorage dismiss (ADR-056). Tracker stub minimo (ADR-055).
    
    Backend:
    - 5 endpoints REST + chart proxy fs-cached + rate limit 1/10s/user
    - 11 servicos/scripts/utils novos
    - Migrations 0014 (tournaments +3 cols backfill heuristico) + 0015
      (primedope_runs com FK users.user_platform_id, indices compostos)
    
    Frontend:
    - 11 componentes/hooks (PrimedopePanel/Wizard/Result/Onboarding,
      DayDetailDrawer, EmptyState compartilhado, 3 hooks TanStack)
    - Integracao em GradePlanner abaixo do PanelGroup atual
    
    Testes: 148/149 verdes (1 falha conhecida: user-event v14 + vitest 4
    fake timers + React 18 incompatibility — debounce multiplier RF-06).
    Lessons learned 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 10, 12 aplicadas.
    
    Documentacao:
    - ADRs 054 (PrimeDope provider externo), 055 (tracker stub), 056
      (localStorage dismiss)
    - 5 diagramas Mermaid (C4 context, sequence, ER, 2 flowcharts)
    - data-model-index + decisions/README atualizados
    
    Reviewer feedback: 1 CRITICAL + 5 HIGH bloqueantes corrigidos
    (userIdFrom userPlatformId, CSRF apiRequest hooks, migration TS
    db.execute, schema delta pgTable, FK userPlatformId, chart
    requireAuth). Causa raiz: mocks idealizados Lesson #3 — testes
    de migration reescritos para mockar db.execute real.
    
    Simplify: 4 fixes safe aplicados (chart TOCTOU sendFile callback,
    clearTimeout cleanup PrimedopeResult, AbortController cleanup
    usePrimedopeSimulation, N+1 hoist wallet currencies).
    
    Dividas tecnicas registradas (defer Sprint F5):
    - FX cascade duplicada 3x → extrair fxResolver.ts
    - queryKey ignora userId → cross-user cache risk
    - formatUsd duplicado 2x → reusar formatCurrency
    - usePrimedopeSimulation sem refresh-on-401 (mantem raw fetch
      por causa do AbortController + signal)
    - e2e integration test com user real (db:push + dev branch)
    
    NAO inclui: native engine variance calc (W3-W4 Sprint F5+).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

